    {
      "addedAt" : "2026-04-03T05:00:00Z",
      "body" : "## Welcome!\nKeep an eye out for new playlists to be highlighted here!\n\n### Where do the playlists live?\nYou can find them on the Music Playlists tab under Cadance Resources.",
      "eligibleFrom" : "2026-04-03T00:00:00Z",
      "eligibleUntil" : "2027-04-30T23:59:59Z",
      "id" : "april-hello",
      "priority" : 5,
      "type" : "message"
    },
    {
      "addedAt" : "2026-04-06T05:00:00Z",
      "body" : "## Cadance 4: What's new:\n- Day Passes are here, great alternative to subscriptions\n- 33 curated playlists pre-installed, including music for Extraordinary Groups and kids' Hip-hop\n- Explore any artist or album catalog instantly from within the app\n- iPad Bluetooth remote with large studio-scale overlay\n- Teacher Lock to prevent accidental screen taps during class\n- Enhanced Apple Watch control\n\n### What has changed:\nThe free tier is now Class Planning mode — unlimited playlist editing with 15-second previews of any track, including Apple Music. Activate a Day Pass or subscribe when it is time to teach.\n\nNeed more Day Passes? They are now available for purchase in-app.",
      "ctaLabel" : "Contact David",
      "ctaUrl" : "mailto:david@cadance.music",
      "eligibleFrom" : "2026-04-03T00:00:00Z",
      "eligibleUntil" : "2027-05-30T23:59:59Z",
      "id" : "version4-intro",
      "priority" : 2,
      "type" : "message"
    },
    {
      "addedAt" : "2026-05-02T05:00:00Z",
      "body" : "## Day Pass: What is it?\nThe perfect alternative to subscriptions, each one gives you full, unrestricted access until midnight on the day you activate it.\n\n## They never expire\nUse them only on the days you teach. Also works as a temporary upgrade to your subscription!\n\n## Need more Day Passes?\nThey are available for purchase in-app.",
      "eligibleFrom" : "2026-05-02T00:00:00Z",
      "eligibleUntil" : "2027-05-30T23:59:59Z",
      "id" : "daypass-explained",
      "priority" : 1,
      "type" : "message"
    },
    {
      "addedAt" : "2026-05-02T05:00:00Z",
      "body" : "## Need Help?\nFor quick feature demos see the focused tips at the link below.",
      "ctaLabel" : "Video Tips",
      "ctaUrl" : "https://cadance.music/how-to.html",
      "eligibleFrom" : "2026-05-02T00:00:00Z",
      "eligibleUntil" : "2027-05-30T23:59:59Z",
      "id" : "get-help",
      "priority" : 1,
      "type" : "message"
    },
    {
      "addedAt" : "2026-04-06T05:00:00Z",
      "body" : "## Start your Day Pass on your terms\nLook for the banner 'Activate your Day Pass' on your first track play - you'll have 10 seconds to stop activation.\n\nIf you stop activation, all tracks played after that will be in Preview mode and reset after 15 seconds.\n\n## Ready to teach?\nGo to Settings (gear icon at the top of the app), scroll to Day Passes section, and select Activate a Day Pass Now.\n\n## Need more Day Passes?\nThey are now available for purchase from this section.",
      "ctaLabel" : "Contact David",
      "ctaUrl" : "mailto:david@cadance.music",
      "eligibleFrom" : "2026-04-03T00:00:00Z",
      "eligibleUntil" : "2027-05-30T23:59:59Z",
      "id" : "start-daypass",
      "priority" : 3,
      "type" : "message"
    },
